From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msxml3: the entities and notations of the document type (6018)

IXMLDOMDocumentType entities and notations were E_NOTIMPL stubs: they are
read-only named node maps of IXMLDOMEntity nodes (the general entities, in
declaration order: publicId, systemId, notationName) and IXMLDOMNotation
nodes (publicId, systemId) (XML-PARSER).
---
